---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Open Source - Fable">
  <div style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h1>Open Source & Transparency</h1>
    <p class="lead">Fable is fully open-source and developed in public.</p>
    
    <div class="card">
      <p>All protocol boundaries, database schemas, and client-side agent loops are inspectable directly within the repository. We believe that AI workspaces must be fully transparent to be trusted with real work.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tauri desktop shell and Rust backend are open for audit.</li>
        <li>Windows preview builds are currently unsigned and available for source-based compilation.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
